      "node_id": "kg_doc_3",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Wilfred Bamnjo (born 27 March 1980 in Cameroon) is a Cameroonian football player who currently plays for Hong Kong First Division League club Happy Valley. His position is defensive midfielder. Supporters have given Bamnjo a nickname of \"Hong Kong Makélélé\".",
